        "summary": "Compound 1 is an SMM. Open hysteresis loops persist up to 1.6 K (sweep rate 0.14 T s−1). AC data give Ueff = 8.3 cm−1. Coercivity increases with decreasing T and increasing sweep rate. No QTM steps near zero field. Quantum relaxation time approaches ~10 s. Magnetization normalized to Ms at 1.4 T.",
